INSERT INTO `blogs` VALUES (1,'test-blog',1,'Test Blog','Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. ','user/1763399304985.jpg','Test One','Test',NULL,'2025-11-17 17:08:24','2025-11-17 17:08:24','2025-11-17 23:53:19'),(3,'test-blog1213',1,'test blog','<p>test blog</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','user/1763407570896.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-17 19:26:10','2025-11-17 19:26:10','2025-11-17 19:26:16'),(4,'jjkjkjkgkj',NULL,'jjkjkjkgkj','<p>hjuhjkhjkh</p>','user/1763407597604.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-17 19:26:37','2025-11-17 19:26:37','2025-11-17 19:26:53'),(5,'werwer',NULL,'werwer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-17 23:53:44','2025-11-17 23:53:44','2025-11-18 00:14:42'),(6,'add-a-unique-modified-car-to-your-garage-custom-cars-for-sale',2,'Add A Unique Modified Car To Your Garage Custom Cars for Sale','<p><span style=\"color: black;\">For car enthusiasts, cars are not just machines, but an experience. A custom car lets you feel a connection with every curve, every engine note, every detail that shows the owner’s passion and unique identity.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Modified cars\' eye-catching designs set them apart from standard production models. For modified car lovers, they make travel exciting and luxurious. One Off Autos makes owning a one-of-a-kind ride easier than ever.</span></p><h2><br></h2><h1><span class=\"ql-size-huge\">What Makes a Car Custom —Modified?</span></h1><p><span style=\"color: black;\">For many people, custom cars are flashy paint, big rims, loud exhausts, and attention-grabbing body kits. But it’s more than that.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Custom-modified cars are vehicles transformed from their factory versions to match the owner’s vision. Modifications go beyond looks, performance, or both.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">They not just change the car body, but also upgrade the engine tuning, suspension, and brakes. Interiors may be upgraded with leather seating, high-end audio, or digital dashboards. Every modification aims to make the car more personal, more exciting, and more in tune that complement the car\'s exterior.&nbsp;</span></p><h2><br></h2><h2>Why Choose Custom Modified Cars</h2><p><span style=\"color: black;\">History is proof that owning a custom car is about pride. It’s about enjoying every moment behind the wheel and feeling the car respond exactly the way you want.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Investing in a custom-modified car comes with clear advantages:</span></p><ul><li>Your car becomes a reflection of your personality. No one else drives the same ride.</li><li>Engine upgrades and suspension tweaks improve speed, handling, and overall driving dynamics.</li><li>From exterior finishes to interior details, it makes the car luxurious.</li><li>Rare or high-quality custom cars can appreciate in value over time.</li><li>Upgraded brakes, tires, lighting, and suspension increase stability and safety.</li></ul><h3><br></h3><h3><br></h3><h3>Popular Custom Cars to Consider</h3><p><span style=\"color: black;\">The custom-modified cars truly show the owner’s creativity, skill, and passion. Here are some standout examples of custom cars:</span></p><ul><li><strong>Off-Road Beasts:</strong> Multi-wheeled vehicles designed for extreme terrain, combining power and bold design.</li><li><strong>Performance Trucks:</strong> Pickups with engine upgrades, premium finishes, and enhanced suspension for both work and play.</li><li><strong>Classic Muscle Cars:</strong> Vintage rides with modern engines, refined exteriors, and improved handling.</li><li><strong>Collector’s Dream Vehicles:</strong> Rare cars with custom detailing and original engines, perfect for enthusiasts and investors.</li></ul><h2><br></h2><h2>Tips for Buying Custom Modified Cars</h2><p><span style=\"color: black;\">If you are planning to purchase a custom car, then stay vigilant about certain things before making a real deal.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Things to keep in mind:</span></p><ol><li>Open a reliable site. Verify and ensure all upgrades are professionally done and documented. Safety and value depend on quality.</li><li>Meet the owner personally in a public place and review maintenance records, and inspect the car thoroughly. Avoid unclear histories.</li><li>Custom car prices vary widely. Research the model and its modifications before making a decision.</li><li>Some upgrades require special parts or servicing. Be prepared for maintenance as per your taste.</li><li>Discuss everything with the owner, from modifications, performance, and prior ownership, to make a real deal.</li></ol><p><br></p><h2>Why Is a Custom Car Worth It?</h2><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Owning a custom car is about more than mechanics. It is about identity. Every curve, every color, and every upgrade shows your personality. No matter if you are opting for a classic one or a modern engine, custom-modified cars allow freedom to express yourself. They make driving exciting.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">The best thing about the custom-modified cars is that they are built to fit your needs and preferences, from improved handling and performance to upgraded interiors and functional features. Every modification gives your car a personalized touch. Unlike standard vehicles, custom cars make the driving experience more comfortable, responsive, and tailored.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Custom cars also increase the resale value, but it totally depends on the quality and looks of the modifications. Well-executed, high-quality upgrades, rare designs, or enhancements to classic and collectible models make it a smart investment.</span></p><h2><br></h2><h2>Where to Find the Best Custom Modified Cars</h2><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Finding the perfect ride starts with knowing the type of car you want, but the reliable site is all you need. One Off Autos is the premier platform connecting buyers and sellers of unique, modified vehicles. A platform built by car enthusiasts for car enthusiasts.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Our car collection ranges from classics and muscle cars to modern tuners and performance vehicles. Each car is </span><strong>listed</strong><span style=\"color: black;\"> with modifications, from engine swaps and suspension setups to body makeovers and personalized interiors.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Beyond just </span><strong>buying</strong><span style=\"color: black;\"> and </span><strong>selling</strong><span style=\"color: black;\">, we have built a community over the years where car enthusiasts can share insights, discover unique builds, and appreciate each other’s work.&nbsp;</span></p><h3><br></h3><h3>Drive Smoothly!</h3><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Custom cars combine passion, individuality, and performance. They give you a ride that is uniquely yours. Thoroughly evaluate your options. Choose a car that excites you and that is functional too. The best custom-modified car is more than a day-to-day vehicle; it is a statement of style, personality, and freedom.</span></p>','user/1763425545687.jpg','Unique Modified Car To Your Garage Custom Cars for Sale','Discover the world of Custom Cars for Sale — explore unique modifications, performance upgrades, and tips for buying the perfect custom ride that suits your style.',NULL,'2025-11-18 00:25:45','2025-11-18 00:25:45','2025-11-18 17:01:01'),(7,'add-a-unique-modified-car-to-your-garage-custom-cars-for-sale1574',2,'Add A Unique Modified Car To Your Garage Custom Cars for Sale','<p>For car enthusiasts, cars are not just machines, but an experience. A custom car lets you feel a connection with every curve, every engine note, every detail that shows the owner’s passion and unique identity.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Modified cars\' eye-catching designs set them apart from standard production models. For modified car lovers, they make travel exciting and luxurious. One Off Autos makes owning a one-of-a-kind ride easier than ever.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h1><span class=\"ql-size-large\">What Makes a Car Custom —Modified?</span></h1><p>For many people, custom cars are flashy paint, big rims, loud exhausts, and attention-grabbing body kits. But it’s more than that.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Custom-modified cars are vehicles transformed from their factory versions to match the owner’s vision. Modifications go beyond looks, performance, or both.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>They not just change the car body, but also upgrade the engine tuning, suspension, and brakes. Interiors may be upgraded with leather seating, high-end audio, or digital dashboards. Every modification aims to make the car more personal, more exciting, and more in tune that complement the car\'s exterior.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Why Choose Custom Modified Cars</p><p>History is proof that owning a custom car is about pride. It’s about enjoying every moment behind the wheel and feeling the car respond exactly the way you want.</p><p><br></p><p>Investing in a custom-modified car comes with clear advantages:</p><p><br></p><p>Your car becomes a reflection of your personality. No one else drives the same ride.</p><p>Engine upgrades and suspension tweaks improve speed, handling, and overall driving dynamics.</p><p>From exterior finishes to interior details, it makes the car luxurious.</p><p>Rare or high-quality custom cars can appreciate in value over time.</p><p>Upgraded brakes, tires, lighting, and suspension increase stability and safety.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Popular Custom Cars to Consider</p><p>The custom-modified cars truly show the owner’s creativity, skill, and passion. Here are some standout examples of custom cars:</p><p><br></p><p>Off-Road Beasts: Multi-wheeled vehicles designed for extreme terrain, combining power and bold design.</p><p>Performance Trucks: Pickups with engine upgrades, premium finishes, and enhanced suspension for both work and play.</p><p>Classic Muscle Cars: Vintage rides with modern engines, refined exteriors, and improved handling.</p><p>Collector’s Dream Vehicles: Rare cars with custom detailing and original engines, perfect for enthusiasts and investors.</p><p><br></p><p>Tips for Buying Custom Modified Cars</p><p>If you are planning to purchase a custom car, then stay vigilant about certain things before making a real deal.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Things to keep in mind:</p><p><br></p><p>Open a reliable site. Verify and ensure all upgrades are professionally done and documented. Safety and value depend on quality.</p><p>Meet the owner personally in a public place and review maintenance records, and inspect the car thoroughly. Avoid unclear histories.</p><p>Custom car prices vary widely. Research the model and its modifications before making a decision.</p><p>Some upgrades require special parts or servicing. Be prepared for maintenance as per your taste.</p><p>Discuss everything with the owner, from modifications, performance, and prior ownership, to make a real deal.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Why Is a Custom Car Worth It?</p><p>Owning a custom car is about more than mechanics. It is about identity. Every curve, every color, and every upgrade shows your personality. No matter if you are opting for a classic one or a modern engine, custom-modified cars allow freedom to express yourself. They make driving exciting.</p><p><br></p><p>The best thing about the custom-modified cars is that they are built to fit your needs and preferences, from improved handling and performance to upgraded interiors and functional features. Every modification gives your car a personalized touch. Unlike standard vehicles, custom cars make the driving experience more comfortable, responsive, and tailored.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Custom cars also increase the resale value, but it totally depends on the quality and looks of the modifications. Well-executed, high-quality upgrades, rare designs, or enhancements to classic and collectible models make it a smart investment.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Where to Find the Best Custom Modified Cars</p><p>Finding the perfect ride starts with knowing the type of car you want, but the reliable site is all you need. One Off Autos is the premier platform connecting buyers and sellers of unique, modified vehicles. A platform built by car enthusiasts for car enthusiasts.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Our car collection ranges from classics and muscle cars to modern tuners and performance vehicles. Each car is listed with modifications, from engine swaps and suspension setups to body makeovers and personalized interiors.</p><p><br></p><p>Beyond just buying and selling, we have built a community over the years where car enthusiasts can share insights, discover unique builds, and appreciate each other’s work.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Drive Smoothly!</p><p>Custom cars combine passion, individuality, and performance. They give you a ride that is uniquely yours. Thoroughly evaluate your options. Choose a car that excites you and that is functional too. The best custom-modified car is more than a day-to-day vehicle; it is a statement of style, personality, and freedom.</p>',NULL,'Add A Unique Modified Car To Your Garage Custom Cars for Sale | One Off Autos','Buy and sell modified street cars easily. Explore custom rides, tuned vehicles, and performance upgrades from passionate car enthusiasts worldwide.',NULL,'2025-11-18 17:04:46','2025-11-18 17:04:46','2025-11-18 17:04:57'),(8,'add-a-unique-modified-car-to-your-garage-custom-cars-for-sale1418',2,'Add A Unique Modified Car To Your Garage Custom Cars for Sale','<p>For car enthusiasts, cars are not just machines, but an experience. A custom car lets you feel a connection with every curve, every engine note, every detail that shows the owner’s passion and unique identity.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Modified cars\' eye-catching designs set them apart from standard production models. For modified car lovers, they make travel exciting and luxurious. One Off Autos makes owning a one-of-a-kind ride easier than ever.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><span class=\"ql-size-large\">What Makes a Car Custom 