span style=\"color: black;\">Meet in public locations or at the buyer\'s bank for transactions. Accept only cashier\'s checks or verified bank transfers. Complete all title work properly and keep copies of all documentation.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Should I offer a warranty when selling my modified car?</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Private sellers typically sell vehicles as-is without warranties. Be honest about the condition and let buyers inspect thoroughly. Some sellers offer short-term guarantees on specific components to build confidence, but this isn\'t required.</span></p>','user/1774025415523.jpg',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-16','2026-03-06 16:35:40','2026-03-06 16:35:40',NULL),(47,'modified-cars-for-sale-custom-car-listings',4,'Explore Modified Cars for Sale with Custom Cars Listings','<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">The opportunity to </span><a href=\"https://oneoffautos.com/buy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>buy modified cars online</strong></a><span style=\"color: black;\"> has transformed how enthusiasts find their perfect vehicles. Digital platforms connect buyers with unique builds nationwide. This accessibility creates opportunities that local shopping simply can\'t match.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Custom builds represent individual creativity and automotive passion. Each modified vehicle tells a story through its upgrades and styling choices. Buyers who appreciate these details seek out specialized platforms to find quality builds.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><h2><strong>Why Modified Cars Appeal to Enthusiasts</strong></h2><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Custom builds express individual personality and style. No two modified vehicles are exactly alike. This uniqueness attracts buyers who want 