market conditions. Unrealistic lowball offers waste time and damage relationships.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Staying connected with sellers can benefit you in the long term. They may know that other vehicles will become available soon. The modified car community thrives on these personal connections.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><h4><strong>Are modified cars reliable for daily driving?</strong></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Professional builds with quality parts can be very reliable. The key is proper installation and regular maintenance. Avoid extreme modifications if you need dependable daily transportation.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><h4><strong>How do I know if modifications were done correctly?</strong></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Request documentation of all work performed, including shop names and receipts. Have a qualified mechanic inspect the vehicle thoroughly. Look for clean installations with proper wiring and mounting.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><h4><strong>Can I get insurance for a heavily modified car?</strong></h4><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Specialty insurance companies cover modified vehicles with agreed-value policies. You\'ll need to document all modifications with photos and receipts. Premiums typically cost more than standard auto insurance.</span></p>','user/1774025486340.webp','Explore Modified Cars for Sale with Custom Car Listings','Explore modified cars for sale with detailed custom car listings. Find unique builds, performance upgrades, and tips for buying modified vehicles online.','2026-03-20','2026-03-06 17:31:52','2026-03-06 17:31:52',NULL),(48,'one-off-autos-selling-your-car-easy',7,'5 Ways One Off Autos Makes Selling Your Car Easy Fast and Hassle Free','<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><a href=\"https://oneoffautos.com/sell\" rel=\"